{%- comment -%}
  AJ Shops — the shops within the shop.

  The Yoink is a deals store, so its browsing furniture is all filters: Shop by
  price, Shop by category, the bin. The Kitchen and the Yoink Skate Shop are not
  filters, they are DESTINATIONS — each one has its own page, its own art
  direction and its own reason to exist — and a text tile in a row of text tiles
  would have filed them as two more ways to sort the same pile.

  So each shop gets a card in its own page's colours, carrying its own mascot.
  The card is a swatch of the place the link goes: click the near-black one and
  you land on a near-black page. That costs nothing and does the job a generic
  tile cannot, which is to say these are different shops rather than different
  queries.

  THE COUNT IS READ LIVE from the collection, so a shop that empties out says so
  rather than promising a rack that is not there. A blank handle just drops the
  line — see `collection_handle` in `aj-bargain-bin` for why these are plain text
  settings and not `collection` pickers: a `collection` picker makes Shopify
  resolve the handle while VALIDATING the template, and an agent-created
  collection does not exist on first deploy, which refuses the whole file.

  THE MASCOT FALLS BACK TO A THEME ASSET. `mascot` is an image_picker for
  swapping art from the editor; when it is empty the section serves
  `mascot_asset` out of `assets/`. That way the art ships with the theme and the
  card is never a coloured rectangle with a hole in it, which is what an
  image_picker alone would have given us on first deploy.

  Slots are blocks rather than a fixed pair so a third shop is a block, not a
  rewrite. A block with a blank name is skipped, so the count is a content
  decision — the same rule the skate page's tiles use.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign renderable = 0
  for block in section.blocks
    if block.settings.name != blank
      assign renderable = renderable | plus: 1
    endif
  endfor
-%}

{%- if renderable > 0 -%}
  <div
    class="aj-shops color-{{ section.settings.color_scheme }} section spacing-style"
    style="{% render 'spacing-style', settings: section.settings %}"
  >
    <div class="page-width">
      {%- if section.settings.eyebrow != blank -%}
        <p class="aj-shops__eyebrow">{{ section.settings.eyebrow | escape }}</p>
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- if section.settings.heading != blank -%}
        <h2 class="aj-shops__heading">{{ section.settings.heading | escape }}</h2>
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- if section.settings.subheading != blank -%}
        <p class="aj-shops__subheading">{{ section.settings.subheading | escape }}</p>
      {%- endif -%}

      <ul class="aj-shops__grid" role="list">
        {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
          {%- if block.settings.name == blank -%}
            {%- continue -%}
          {%- endif -%}

          {%- liquid
            assign shop_collection = collections[block.settings.collection_handle]
            assign shop_count = 0
            if block.settings.collection_handle != blank
              assign shop_count = shop_collection.all_products_count
            endif

            assign mascot_src = blank
            if block.settings.mascot != blank
              assign mascot_src = block.settings.mascot | image_url: width: 900
            elsif block.settings.mascot_asset != blank
              assign mascot_src = block.settings.mascot_asset | asset_url
            endif
          -%}

          <li class="aj-shops__item" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
            <a
              class="aj-shops__card"
              href="{{ block.settings.link | default: '#' }}"
              style="
                --aj-shops-bg: {{ block.settings.bg_color }};
                --aj-shops-fg: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
                --aj-shops-accent: {{ block.settings.accent_color }};
                --aj-shops-on-accent: {{ block.settings.accent_text_color }};
                {%- comment -%}
                  `default` before the divide, because a missing setting divides
                  to 0 and a scale of 0 is an invisible mascot on a live card.
                {%- endcomment -%}
                --aj-shops-scale: {{ block.settings.mascot_scale | default: 100 | divided_by: 100.0 }};
              "
            >
              {%- comment -%}
                The mascot is decorative: the shop's name sits in text directly
                under it, so a described image would announce the same shop
                twice to a screen reader.
              {%- endcomment -%}
              {%- if mascot_src != blank -%}
                <span class="aj-shops__stage">
                  <img
                    class="aj-shops__mascot"
                    src="{{ mascot_src }}"
                    alt=""
                    loading="lazy"
                    width="600"
                    height="600"
                  >
                </span>
              {%- endif -%}

              <span class="aj-shops__body">
                <span class="aj-shops__name">{{ block.settings.name | escape }}</span>

                {%- if block.settings.blurb != blank -%}
                  <span class="aj-shops__blurb">{{ block.settings.blurb | escape }}</span>
                {%- endif -%}

                {%- if shop_count > 0 -%}
                  <span class="aj-shops__count">
                    {{ shop_count }}
                    {%- if shop_count == 1 %} item{% else %} items{% endif -%}
                  </span>
                {%- endif -%}

                {%- if block.settings.cta != blank -%}
                  <span class="aj-shops__cta">{{ block.settings.cta | escape }}</span>
                {%- endif -%}
              </span>
            </a>
          </li>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
{%- elsif request.design_mode -%}
  <div class="aj-shops aj-shops--empty page-width">
    <p>
      <strong>No shops yet.</strong>
      Add a shop block and give it a name. Blocks with a blank name are skipped.
    </p>
  </div>
{%- endif -%}

{% stylesheet %}
  .aj-shops__eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 0.25rem;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  .aj-shops__heading {
    margin: 0 0 0.25rem;
  }

  .aj-shops__subheading {
    margin: 0 0 var(--padding-md, 1.5rem);
    opacity: 0.75;
  }

  .aj-shops__grid {
    display: grid;
    /* auto-fit rather than a hard two-up, so a third shop is a block and not a
       ragged final row. 20rem is wide enough that a card never squeezes the
       mascot into a stamp. */
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(20rem, 100%), 1fr));
    gap: var(--padding-sm, 1rem);
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  /*
    THE CARD IS THE SHOP'S OWN GROUND, not a theme colour. Every value here comes
    off the block so the two cards can disagree — that is the point of them.
  */
  .aj-shops__card {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    height: 100%;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: var(--aj-shops-bg, #282828);
    color: var(--aj-shops-fg, #ffffff);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: transform 0.14s ease;
  }

  .aj-shops__card:hover,
  .aj-shops__card:focus-visible {
    transform: translateY(-3px);
  }

  /*
    The mascot stands on a floor rather than floating: a soft pool of the accent
    behind it grounds a cut-out with no background of its own, and keeps the
    bright art from sitting on flat black like a sticker.
  */
  .aj-shops__stage {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-end;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 1.25rem 1rem 0;
    background:
      radial-gradient(
        ellipse 58% 40% at 50% 100%,
        color-mix(in srgb, var(--aj-shops-accent, #ffe000) 34%, transparent) 0%,
        transparent 72%
      );
  }

  /*
    SCALED PER SHOP, because aspect ratio is not visual weight. The pickle is a
    tall narrow figure and the skater a wide compact one; at the same height the
    skater reads noticeably bigger. There is no automatic fix for that — it is a
    judgement about the art — so it is a setting rather than a constant.
  */
  .aj-shops__mascot {
    width: auto;
    height: calc(clamp(10rem, 25vw, 15rem) * var(--aj-shops-scale, 1));
    max-width: 100%;
    object-fit: contain;
    /* The art is pixel work. A drop shadow would blur its edges, so the lift on
       hover is the only movement it gets. */
    transition: transform 0.14s ease;
  }

  .aj-shops__card:hover .aj-shops__mascot,
  .aj-shops__card:focus-visible .aj-shops__mascot {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
  }

  .aj-shops__body {
    display: flex;
    flex: 1 1 auto;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.4rem 1.5rem;
  }

  .aj-shops__name {
    font-size: clamp(1.375rem, 2.2vw, 1.75rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .aj-shops__blurb {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.45;
    opacity: 0.85;
  }

  /* Pushed to the bottom so the button lines up across cards whose blurbs run to
     different lengths. */
  .aj-shops__count {
    margin-top: auto;
    padding-top: 0.6rem;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    opacity: 0.6;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }

  /*
    THE ACCENT IS A BACKGROUND, NEVER TYPE — see assets/aj-brand.css. The skate
    shop's accent is brand purple, which is 2.79:1 against its own near-black
    card and would be unreadable as a coloured label; as a filled pill carrying
    white it is 6.90:1. The Kitchen's optic yellow carries its deep green at
    11.7:1. Both pass because the colour is under the words rather than in them.
  */
  .aj-shops__cta {
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--aj-shops-accent, #ffe000);
    color: var(--aj-shops-on-accent, #282828);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .aj-shops__card,
    .aj-shops__mascot {
      transition: none;
    }

    .aj-shops__card:hover,
    .aj-shops__card:focus-visible,
    .aj-shops__card:hover .aj-shops__mascot,
    .aj-shops__card:focus-visible .aj-shops__mascot {
      transform: none;
    }
  }

  .aj-shops--empty {
    padding-block: var(--padding-xl, 3rem);
    text-align: center;
  }
{% endstylesheet %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "AJ Shops",
  "tag": "section",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "The shops within the shop. Each block is one shop, in its own page's colours. A block with a blank name is skipped."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "eyebrow",
      "label": "Eyebrow",
      "default": "Shops within the shop"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "Heading",
      "default": "We run a couple of specialist shops"
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "subheading",
      "label": "Subheading",
      "default": "Specialist gear, filed where you would expect it. Same cart, same checkout."
    },
    {
      "type": "color_scheme",
      "id": "color_scheme",
      "label": "Color scheme",
      "default": "scheme-1"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Padding"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding-block-start",
      "label": "Top",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 32
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding-block-end",
      "label": "Bottom",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 32
    }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "shop",
      "name": "Shop",
      "settings": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "name",
          "label": "Shop name",
          "info": "Leave blank to hide this shop."
        },
        {
          "type": "textarea",
          "id": "blurb",
          "label": "Blurb"
        },
        {
          "type": "url",
          "id": "link",
          "label": "Link"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "cta",
          "label": "Button text",
          "default": "Have a look"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "collection_handle",
          "label": "Collection handle",
          "info": "Plain handle, e.g. pickleball. Used only for the live item count — leave blank to hide the count."
        },
        {
          "type": "header",
          "content": "Mascot"
        },
        {
          "type": "image_picker",
          "id": "mascot",
          "label": "Mascot image",
          "info": "Overrides the built-in art below. Cut out, no background of its own."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "mascot_asset",
          "label": "Built-in mascot file",
          "info": "A file in the theme's assets folder, used when no image is picked above. aj-shop-mascot-kitchen.svg or aj-shop-mascot-skate.svg."
        },
        {
          "type": "range",
          "id": "mascot_scale",
          "label": "Mascot size",
          "min": 60,
          "max": 140,
          "step": 5,
          "unit": "%",
          "default": 100,
          "info": "Match the mascots by eye, not by number — a tall thin character needs more height than a wide one to look the same size."
        },
        {
          "type": "header",
          "content": "Colours",
          "info": "Match the shop's own page so the card previews where the link goes."
        },
        {
          "type": "color",
          "id": "bg_color",
          "label": "Card colour",
          "default": "#282828"
        },
        {
          "type": "color",
          "id": "text_color",
          "label": "Text colour",
          "default": "#ffffff"
        },
        {
          "type": "color",
          "id": "accent_color",
          "label": "Button colour",
          "default": "#ffe000"
        },
        {
          "type": "color",
          "id": "accent_text_color",
          "label": "Button text colour",
          "default": "#282828",
          "info": "Check this against the button colour. The accent is a background here, never type."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "max_blocks": 4,
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "AJ Shops",
      "blocks": [{ "type": "shop" }, { "type": "shop" }]
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
